WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:05.000
Lesson 4.2 · People, Culture & Volunteers
Recruitment and fair selection

2
00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:11.800
Fair recruitment uses clear criteria, the same questions for everyone and proportionate safety checks.

3
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:15.600
1. Agree criteria and scoring before reading applications.

4
00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:18.200
2. Advertise where the people you want actually look.

5
00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:22.200
3. Complete safeguarding checks before anyone starts.

6
00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:23.800
An example: Riverside Repair Hub (Hybrid · charity with a trading company, United Kingdom)

7
00:00:23.800 --> 00:00:31.000
“Schools officer: five criteria, two scorers, a 15-minute practical task, references and DBS check before the first school visit.”

8
00:00:31.600 --> 00:00:33.400
You create a fair recruitment process for your next role.

9
00:00:33.400 --> 00:00:37.400
Then save it, and download it as a PDF.

10
00:00:38.900 --> 00:00:42.000
Method into Impact
Better foundations. Stronger organisations.
